clusion:**   The HPO concept "Decreased naive CD8+ T cell proportion" describes a measurable immunological deviation reflecting a diminished pool of unexposed, antigen-naïve cytotoxic T cells. It is a specific, quantitative immune phenotype with implications for immune responsiveness, memory formation, and disease susceptibility, primarily within the context of adaptive immunity and T cell homeostasis.
